        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3e_cMALyHiXIr7QJ2uHbZe9RJlcvhhNNUVJNveu8JW3ru1pA6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Fantastic. Local taco shack serving generous sized tacos. Not the most authentic style of tacos but regardless they are delicious! Staff is super friendly, I would go back just to talk to the staff. Highly recommend to anyone in the area, truly a hidden gem!",
        "time": 1747329073,
        "translated": false
      },
