        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "So delicious a must try spot, staff was super friendly and food is amazing and flavorful",
        "time": 1746810374,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Richard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107347509419992198011/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7AprhecFCvbsxffezix2yAti4e5FvbxixOToblf0LSYlzKti9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "No need to travel all the way to Mexico for authentic Tacos; they have that right here in Pincourt; and even the fries are tasty !  I was looking for a refreshing change, this will be my go-to place now.  And best of all, they are dog friendly so next time I will come with my well-behaved Shiba Inu dog.   Adios Amigos from happy gringo!",
        "time": 1754588136,
        "translated": false
      },
